 dealing with a left groin strain, Immanuel Quickley, who has a right hamstring issue, and Collin Murray-Boyles, who is ill, will not be available for the team. This absence comes as the Raptors (5-4) prepare to host the Grizzlies. Barnes and Quickley also missed the team's previous game against the Milwaukee Bucks, which they won 121-107. Murray-Boyles was listed as questionable just hours before the game. Additionally, star forward Kawhi Leonard, who is managing a left knee injury, and reserve center Nate Bittle, who has a right foot avulsion fracture, were already ruled out. Barnes and Quickley are regular starters for Toronto, while Murray-Boyles typically comes off the bench. The Raptors' lineup adjustments will be crucial as they aim to maintain their momentum in the NBA season. This report by The Canadian Press was first published on November 9, 2026.", "title": "Raptors missing key players for Grizzlies matchup", "uri": "https://en.killbait.com/raptors-missing-key-players-for-grizzlies-matchup.html?utm_source=bluesky&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=killbaitcanada.bsky.social"}}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 127, "byteStart": 119}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "grizzlies"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 138, "byteStart": 128}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "injuries"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 148, "byteStart": 139}}], "text": "Raptors missing key players for Grizzlies matchup\n\n\ud83e\udd16 IA: It's not clickbait \u2705\n\ud83d\udc65 Users: It's not clickbait \u2705\n\n#raptors #grizzlies #injuries \n\n\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47"}, "embed": {"external": {"uri": "https://en.killbait.com/raptors-missing-key-players-for-grizzlies-matchup.html?utm_source=bluesky&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=killbaitcanada.bsky.social", "title": "Raptors missing key players for Grizzlies matchup", "description": "The Toronto Raptors will be without three key players for their game against the Memphis Grizzlies tonight. All-star Scottie Barnes, who is dealing with a left groin strain, Immanuel Quickley, who has a right hamstring issue, and Collin Murray-Boyles, who is ill, will not be available for the team. This absence comes as the Raptors (5-4) prepare to host the Grizzlies. Barnes and Quickley also missed the team's previous game against the Milwaukee Bucks, which they won 121-107. Murray-Boyles was listed as questionable just hours before the game. Additionally, star forward Kawhi Leonard, who is managing a left knee injury, and reserve center Nate Bittle, who has a right foot avulsion fracture, were already ruled out. Barnes and Quickley are regular starters for Toronto, while Murray-Boyles typically comes off the bench. The Raptors' lineup adjustments will be crucial as they aim to maintain their momentum in the NBA season. This report by The Canadian Press was first published on November 9, 2026."}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-10T01:04:59.578Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:i7pcqindxdleiildptnaikoa/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwank7z4s2c", "cid": "bafyreigbyk6zuifopokjl4ne63nopbo4yhy3mbfdxsp67u7bqd4htx4p4y", "author": {"did": "did:plc:i7pcqindxdleiildptnaikoa", "handle": "woodleysean.bsky.social", "displayName": "Sean Woodley", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:i7pcqindxdleiildptnaikoa/bafkreif7zlhbnnm3xbaxmsq7ucnjqoicu3sxmsxxm7ahq5st57meipceyy", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2024-11-06T18:59:02.580Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T01:03:54.536Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "more and more are saying that the raptors are the deepest team in the NBA"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 4, "quoteCount": 0,